\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces System Architecture of the Dynamic Trust Decay Framework. The off-chain layer consists of $N$ oracle nodes submitting price reports. The AEWMA computation pipeline processes reports through four stages: volatility calculation ($\sigma _t$), adaptive alpha computation ($\alpha _t$), edge weight update ($w_{ij,t}$), and trust score derivation ($S_{i,t}$). The on-chain smart contract verifies consensus, manages trust scores, and executes slashing penalties via the trust registry stored on the blockchain.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
