\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Impact of Whitewashing Attack. At $t=100$, the adversary switches behavior. The proposed method (solid red) detects the trust drop significantly faster than the static method (dashed blue), crossing the slashing threshold $\tau =0.4$ within 2 rounds compared to 9 rounds for the baseline.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
